      "id": "u_9f90cec5452b72a80f8dbba0_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Starting with version v0.104.0, Trilium's importer was expanded to application-specific imports. Unlike the standard HTML or __TRILIUM_PH_0__Markdown__TRILIUM_PH_1__ import/export, these importers are tailored to support the features and note structure of a particular application.",
      "sourceHash": "9f90cec5452b72a80f8dbba0dae17cb941e1657f1b3f86d093bbae61dc0da439",
      "context": "Importing data from other applications",
