      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a5f55fdcb851548dd555adce_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__, right click on a note and select __TRILIUM_PH_2__Import into note__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "a5f55fdcb851548dd555adce39e29f801337840f7736e3b77b555788c20918bc",
      "context": "Importing data from other applications > Importing data from another application",
      "contextHash": "b02ff20da9348cfabb6c8cfea47d67d993c438adfff5f03ff20c7896f5c1f047",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e96a2e54b2b0229177589eea_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_1__, select __TRILIUM_PH_2__Import files__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "e96a2e54b2b0229177589eea9f9e8da23523724f6a50985f4e8f0d457ac19050",
      "context": "Importing data from other applications > Importing data from another application",
      "contextHash": "b02ff20da9348cfabb6c8cfea47d67d993c438adfff5f03ff20c7896f5c1f047",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_577721602cdc04fd3c9052e9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A list of supported applications will appear at the top, each with their own configuration. Simply click one and proceed with the on-screen instructions.",
      "sourceHash": "577721602cdc04fd3c9052e9e65788cc2a50c88768dc654b0d68fb942742f82c",
      "context": "Importing data from other applications > Importing data from another application",
